  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You always have a trick up your barrel.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Any three munitions techniques, triggerman level 5th</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you reload a firearm with standard ammunition, choose acid, cold, electricity, or fire. Until the next time you reload that firearm, attacks made with that firearm using standard ammunition deal an additional 2 points of damage of the chosen type.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/triggerman-feats#toc4\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
